{"Title":"An Act amending the charter of the town of Northborough","BillNumber":"H3903","DocketNumber":"HD4374","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"K_D1","Name":"Kate Donaghue","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/K_D1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-30T15:25:55.683"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"K_D1","Name":"Kate Donaghue","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/K_D1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-30T15:25:55.6833333"},{"Id":"M_K1","Name":"Meghan K. Kilcoyne","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/M_K1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-31T15:04:39.8866667"},{"Id":"RKK0","Name":"Robyn K. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RKK0","ResponseDate":"2023-05-31T16:40:31.1366667"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"M_K1","Name":"Meghan K. Kilcoyne","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/M_K1","ResponseDate":"2023-05-30T15:25:55.683"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3903/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Donaghue of Westborough and Kilcoyne of Clinton, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3903) of Kate Donaghue, Meghan Kilcoyne and Robyn K. Kennedy (by vote of the town) that the town of Northborough be authorized to amend the charter of said town.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 4-1 of article IV of the charter of the town of Northborough, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth, as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by striking out the fourth sentence. \r\n\tSECTION 2. This act shall take effect upon its passage. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H36","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H36"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Correctly Drawn","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}